Output assets/wrap.gif
Require tui-textarea-wrap
Set Height 400
Source recordings/common.tape
Env TUI_TEXTAREA_RECORDING_SIZE "120x20"

Hide
Type "tui-textarea-wrap"
Enter
Sleep 750ms
Show

Type "1"
Sleep 750ms
Type "2"
Sleep 750ms
Type "3"
Sleep 750ms
Type "4"
Sleep 750ms
Down 3
Up
Sleep 1s

Hide
Escape
Sleep 250ms
